# os-local ignore for arm64 build artifacts. Kept under os/arm64 so the rule
# lives next to the generated files it governs.
#
# The privileged agentd, Deno runtime, and Wasmtime runtime are build artifacts,
# not source. The arm64 configs plan where they are staged, but this slice
# commits only plans, arch-independent overlay files, and structural tests.
agent-overlay/usr/lib/vita/
ts-runtime-overlay/usr/lib/vita/deno
ts-runtime-overlay/usr/lib/vita/bin/wasmtime
out/

# Vita LUKS TEST keystore. THROWAWAY, per-host, and never part of a shipped image.
.luks/
